    summary_60s: 'Skewness Skewness refers to the asymmetry or deviation from the symmetry in a data distribution. In a normal distribution, the mean (average) and mode (most frequent value) coincide, resulting in a symmetric, bell-shaped curve on a graph. Types of Skewness Positive Skewness : Whe',
